OL,3,GNEWSAThousands enjoy park's 100th
OL,4,Abirthday party
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people enjoyed a
OL,7,Ftwo-day party to mark the 100th
OL,8,Fbirthday of Blackpool's Stanley Park.
OL,10,FThe Grade II listed park officially
OL,11,Freached its centenary on Friday, 100
OL,12,Fyears after it first opened its gates
OL,13,Fin 1926.
OL,15,FDeputy Lieutenant of Lancashire, Sir
OL,16,FBill Beaumont, re-enacted the official
OL,17,Fopening of the park's gates, just as it
OL,18,Fhappened originally.
